  "short_description": "<p>Handwoven from natural bamboo by Vietnamese artisans, this eco-friendly pendant light brings natural warmth and elegance to any space — perfect for hotels, restaurants, and home decor.</p>",
  "description": "<h3 data-start=\"197\" data-end=\"227\"><strong data-start=\"201\" data-end=\"225\">Product Description:</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"228\" data-end=\"488\">This <strong data-start=\"233\" data-end=\"263\">woven bamboo pendant light</strong> is a perfect blend of traditional craftsmanship and modern design. Each pendant is <strong data-start=\"347\" data-end=\"393\">handcrafted by skilled Vietnamese artisans</strong> using natural bamboo — a renewable, eco-friendly material known for its strength and beauty.</p>\n<p data-start=\"490\" data-end=\"789\">The natural weaving pattern creates a warm, diffused glow, making it ideal for <strong data-start=\"569\" data-end=\"621\">restaurants, hotels, resorts, and home interiors</strong> that seek a cozy, tropical, or bohemian atmosphere. Every piece is unique, highlighting the artisanal charm and cultural heritage of Vietnam’s bamboo craft villages.</p>\n<p data-start=\"791\" data-end=\"1069\">At <strong data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"825\">Vietnam Handicraft Co., Ltd</strong>, we specialize in producing and exporting <strong data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"902\">bamboo lighting and home decor</strong> products. We supply to importers, distributors, and interior design brands worldwide, offering <strong data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1036\">custom shapes, sizes, and finishes</strong> for bulk and wholesale orders.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1306\"><strong data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1110\">Supplier &amp; Manufacturer in Vietnam:</strong><br data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1113\" />We provide high-quality, handmade bamboo pendant lamps, sustainably sourced and crafted in Vietnam.<br data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1215\" />📩 Contact: <strong data-start=\"1227\" data-end=\"1254\"><a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1252\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com</a></strong> | 🌐 <a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1260\" data-end=\"1304\">https://vietcraft.vn</a></p>\n<h3 data-start=\"1308\" data-end=\"1331\"><strong data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1329\">Key Features:</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1596\">\n<li data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1365\">\n<p data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1365\">Material: 100% Natural Bamboo</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1366\" data-end=\"1397\">\n<p data-start=\"1368\" data-end=\"1397\">Origin: Handmade in Vietnam</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1398\" data-end=\"1430\">\n<p data-start=\"1400\" data-end=\"1430\">Eco-friendly and sustainable</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1484\">\n<p data-start=\"1433\" data-end=\"1484\">Beautiful light diffusion through natural weaving</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1546\">\n<p data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"1546\">Suitable for home, restaurant, hotel, or resort interiors</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1547\" data-end=\"1596\">\n<p data-start=\"1549\" data-end=\"1596\">Custom designs available for wholesale orders</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1841\" data-end=\"1972\">",
